.TH "GIO-QUERYMODULES" 1 "" "GIO" "glib-compile-schemas"
.SH NAME
gio-querymodules \- GIO module cache creation
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.ad l
.hy 0
.HP 17
\fBgio\-querymodules\fR {DIRECTORY...}
.ad
.hy

.SH "DESCRIPTION"

.PP
\fBgio\-querymodules\fR creates a \fIgiomodule\&.cache\fR file in the listed directories\&. This file lists the implemented extension points for each module that has been found\&. It is used by GIO at runtime to avoid opening all modules just to find out which extension points they are implementing\&.

.PP
GIO modules are usually installed in the \fIgio/modules\fR subdirectory of libdir\&.

